---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import {business} from '../data/business';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Draft for Business Review" description="Draft privacy notice explaining the website enquiry form, external FormSubmit processing and contact details for Ekramul All Repairing Service Center." noindex>
<PageHero crumb="Privacy Policy" title="Privacy policy" eyebrow="WEBSITE INFORMATION" description="A draft notice describing the website’s current enquiry features. The business should review and confirm this notice before launch."/>
<section class="section"><article class="wrap legal prose"><span class="draft-badge">Draft for business review</span><h2>Information in an enquiry</h2><p>The enquiry form requests your name, mobile number, email address, service category and a description of the equipment issue. These details help the service center understand and respond to your enquiry. Please avoid including passwords, financial details or other information that is not needed to discuss the equipment.</p><h2>How the form is processed</h2><p>When you submit the form, the information is sent to FormSubmit for processing and onward delivery to the business email address. FormSubmit may provide verification or anti-spam steps. Its own privacy practices apply to its service. Review <a class="text-link" href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FormSubmit’s privacy notice</a> for its handling of information.</p><h2>Other contact options</h2><p>If you contact the business by telephone or email, the information you share is handled through those channels. You can contact the service center directly if you prefer not to use the website form.</p><h2>External links and website features</h2><p>The Google Maps link opens an external address search. No embedded map or analytics tracker is included in this implementation. The gallery uses locally hosted photographs and videos; fonts are also hosted locally. Your hosting provider may process standard request information when serving the site.</p><h2>Details the business must confirm</h2><p>Information retention periods, access arrangements, deletion procedures, hosting-provider details and any additional legal disclosures require confirmation by the business. This draft does not make commitments about those unconfirmed practices.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>Contact {business.name} at <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> or call <a class="text-link" href={`tel:${business.phone}`}>{business.phoneDisplay}</a>. Address: {business.address}.</p></article></section>
</Layout>
